contentText:
Madonna surprised fans by bringing out Kylie Minogue for a special performance during WorldPride Amsterdam 2026.

As part of her Club Confessions shows celebrating her Billboard 200 No. 1 album Confessions II , Madonna delivered a 30-minute set at Amsterdam&#8217;s AFAS Live that featured a rare live collaboration with the Australian pop superstar.

